    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuay Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ti̱ti̱ a kuay I-thɛ-rɛl. Rɛ-u-ben kɛnɛ Cim-on kɛ Lii-bay kɛnɛ Juda kɛ Yi-tha-kar kɛnɛ Dhɛ-bu-lun, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ Daan kɛnɛ Jo-thɛp kɛ Ben-ya-min kɛnɛ Nap-ta-li kɛ Gad kɛnɛ A-cɛr.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Juda a Ër kɛnɛ O-nan kɛ Cɛla. Kɛn gaat da̱ŋ diɔ̱k ti̱ti̱ cua kɛ da̱p jɛ ɛ nya Kɛ-naan mi cɔal i̱ Bath-cuwa. Kä kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ Juda ni Ër cuɛ dueer la̱t nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä cuɛ jɛ jak kä li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ciek gatdɛ ni Ër mi cɔal Ta-mar jɛ da̱p Pɛ-rɛdh kɛnɛ Dhɛra. Kä cu gaatkɛ diaal a dhieec ɛn Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Pɛ-rɛdh a Ɣɛdh-ron kɛnɛ A-mul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Dhɛra a Dhim-ri kɛnɛ E-than kɛ Ɣe-man kɛnɛ Kɛ̈l-kol kɛ Dara kɛn diaal kɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gat Kar-mi a A-kar mëë cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl nöŋ da̱k kɛ yäri kä tin ca ley Kuoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gat E-than a Ä-dhar-yaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kar kua̱r ni Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat tëë ca da̱p Ɣɛdh-ron a Yɛ-ra̱-mel kɛnɛ Raam kɛ Kɛ-lu-bay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Raam a gua̱n A-mi-na-dab, kä cu A-mi-na-dab a gua̱n Na-con bo̱o̱th ji̱ Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Na-con a gua̱n Thɛ̈l-ma, kä cu Thɛ̈l-ma a gua̱n Bo-ɛ̈dh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bo-ɛ̈dh a gua̱n O-bɛd, kä cu O-bɛd a gua̱n Jɛthi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Jɛthi a gua̱n Ɛli-ab gatdɛ min kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ kɛnɛ gurɛ ni Ä-bi-na-dab, kä cua guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ Cima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Cima guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ Nɛ-tan-el kä cua Nɛ-tan-el guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ Ra-day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Ra-day guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ O-dhɛm kä cua O-dhɛm guɔ̱ɔ̱r ɛ Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nyiee mani a Dhɛ-ru-yaa kɛnɛ Ä-bi-ga-yil. Kä cu gaat Dhɛ-ru-yaa a Ä-bi-cay kɛnɛ Yo-ab kɛ Ä-tha-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-bi-ga-yil a man Ä-ma-tha kä cu gua̱n Ä-ma-tha a Yɛ-thɛr raan I-ca-mel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuay Ɣɛdh-ron",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ka-leb gat Ɣɛdh-ron tekɛ gaat kɛ ciekdɛ ni Ä-dhu-baa kɛ Yɛ-ri-oth. Kä cu gaatkɛ a Ye-cɛr kɛnɛ Co-bab kɛ Ar-don. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ä-dhu-baa li̱w, cu Ka-leb Ɛp-rath kuɛn mëë cu jɛ da̱p Ɣur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣur a gua̱n Uri, kä cu Uri a gua̱n Be-dha-lel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ɣɛdh-ron tekɛ run ti jiɛɛn bäkɛl cuɛ nya Ma-kir min la gua̱n Gil-yad wä kuɛn. Kä cuɛ jɛ da̱p gat mi cɔali Thɛ-gub. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Thɛ-gub a gua̱n Ya-ir mëë cu wi̱i̱ ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k ruac muun Gil-yad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Gɛ-cur kɛnɛ Ä-ram Ɣa-woth-ya-ir, kɛnɛ Kɛ-nat kɛ wi̱i̱kɛ, wi̱i̱ ti jiɛɛn bäkɛl cuakɛ käp. Kɛn nɛy diaal tin cieŋ thi̱n kɛ kuay Ma-kir gua̱n Gil-yad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Ɣɛdh-ron li̱w, cu Ka-leb ciek gua̱n ni Ɛp-ra-tha ka̱n, kä cuɛ da̱p A̱-cur mëë cu wec Tɛ-kowa yiɛth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuay Yɛ-ra̱-mel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
