        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ti̱ti̱ a gaat Yɛ-ra̱-mel kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ Ɣɛdh-ron, cua Raam kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ Yɛ-ra̱-mel a Bunaa kɛ O-rɛn kɛnɛ O-dhɛm kɛ Ä-ɣi-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ra̱-mel tekɛ ciek mi dɔ̱ŋ mi cɔalkɛ ciötdɛ i̱ Ä-ta-raa, kä cua man O-nam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Raam kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ Yɛ-ra̱-mel a Maadh kɛnɛ Ya-min kɛ E-kɛr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat O-nam Ca-may kɛnɛ Yada. Kä cu gaat Ca-may a Na-dab kɛnɛ Ä-bi-cur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua ciek Ä-bi-cur cɔli Ä-bi-ɣa-yil kä cuɛ dapkɛ Ä-ban kɛnɛ Mo-lid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Na-dab a Thɛ-lɛd kɛnɛ A-pa-yim. Kä cu Thɛ-lɛd li̱w a thil gaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gat A-pa-yim a Yici min cua̱ gua̱n Ce-can. Kä cu Ce-can a gua̱n Ɛ̈k-lay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Yada a Yɛ-thɛr kɛnɛ Jo-na-than kä cu Yɛ-thɛr li̱w a thilɛ jɛ gaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gaat Jo-na-than a Pɛ-lɛth kɛnɛ Dha-dha. Kä cua kɛn gaat Yɛ-ra̱-mel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ce-can thil dhɔɔl cu te ni jɛn kɛ nyi̱er. Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ tekɛ kuany mi raan I-jëp mi cɔali Yara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ nyaadɛ kuen kuanydɛ ni Yara, kä cuɛ da̱p gat mi cɔali Ɛ̈-tay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈-tay a gua̱n Na-than, kä cu Na-than a gua̱n Dha-bad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dha-bad a gua̱n Ɛp-lal, kä cu Ɛp-lal a gua̱n O-bɛd. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu O-bɛd a gua̱n Yeɣu, kä cu Yeɣu a gua̱n Ä-dhar-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-dhar-yaa a gua̱n Ɣɛ-ledh, kä cu Ɣɛ-ledh a gua̱n Ɛl-a-thaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛl-a-thaa a gua̱n Thith-may, kä cu Thith-may a gua̱n Cɛ̈-lum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Cɛ̈-lum a gua̱n Yɛ-kam-yaa, kä cu Yɛ-kam-yaa a gua̱n Ɛli-cama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gaat Ka-leb",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
